Subject: [PATCH 0/2] arm64: dts: qcom: Add Google Pixel 2 (walleye)

Add a minimal board file for the Google Pixel 2 (MSM8998): reserved memory,
the RPM regulators of the USB 2.0 PHY, the USB controller as a high-speed
gadget, ramoops and the debug UART.

Storage, display, touch, GPU, Wi-Fi and the remote processors follow
separately.

Not tested: this exact file has not booted yet; the board file it was cut
from boots to a USB gadget shell on the phone (v7.3).

